### Case: create-valid — a ticket that follows the rule.
###
### Expect 201 from the ticket service (jsonplaceholder echoes the ticket with
### id 101). The response carries the backend's own X-Powered-By header, which
### is how you know the request reached it.
POST {{GATEWAY}}/tickets
content-type: application/json

{"title": "Printer on fire", "priority": "high"}
